"An article of hand-produced apparel that George Washington himself could look"
" down upon with an approving smile, the daintiness of this necklace's "
"precious metal chain looks rather comical when compared against the "
"gargantuan pendant that hangs from it: an expended casing from a grenade "
"round, shotgun cartridge, or some other form of sizable munition."
